    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d161">

                <pb facs="0149" n="145" xml:id="pg145"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/12432: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Canton</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Linnell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Canton</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-02-16T16:00:00+08:00">February 16, 1938—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 16—8:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Foreign flag, chiefly British, Canton bound river steamers including A. P.
                        C.<anchor n="94" xml:id="d161-f1"/> oil lighters on first voyage following
                    reopening of river signaled and boarded by two parties from three Japanese
                    destroyers below Bocca Tigris yesterday and warned dangerous to proceed because
                    forts likely to be shelled. China navigation steamer <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Fatshan</hi> proceeded Canton despite warning without incident reporting a
                    few shells heard but no bombardment. All other vessels returned Hong Kong or
                    Macao. Believed Japanese hoped by action to discourage river traffic.</p>
                <p>Press reports recent courtesy visit to Canton of Eighth Route Army
                    representative.</p>
                <p>Mailed Hong Kong, Tokyo.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Linnell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d161-f1" n="94" xml:id="d161-f1-content">
                <p>Asiatic Petroleum Company (British).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
